error[TYP005]: shift `<<` requires a primitive integer left operand and a `u64` count
 --> tests/golden/compile_fail/integer_shift_operator_types.ska:10:7
    |
10 |     1 << 1;
    |       ^^ operator cannot be applied to these operand types
    |
10 |     1 << 1;
    |     - left operand has type `i64`
    |
10 |     1 << 1;
    |          - count operand has type `i64`
  = note: left operand types are `i64`, `u64`, or `u8`; the count type is exactly `u64`

